  {
   "id": "gundam-breaker-4-287853@major-2025-03-13",
   "gameId": "gundam-breaker-4-287853",
   "displayName": "【New Game Update Details】",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-03-13T02:00:48.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Breakers! Install the latest update to add new Mobile Suits, improve stability of gameplay, and fix various bugs. Please apply the latest patch and continue to BREAK, BUILD and BATTLE!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "●Major Updates",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "【New Mobile Suits Added!】",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・GQuuuuuuX",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Gundam EX (Gundam: Requiem for Vengeance)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They will be available for purchase in the in-game store.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "【Newly Added! Master Skills Settings】",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When using master skills, a new setting has been added to display a hologram of the master skill without replacing the mastered parts, while still showing the currently equipped part. (This can be switched in the configuration.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "【More items and functions!】",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Adjustment on Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The effects of the Burst Actions 'Proud Defender' and 'Convergent Heavy Nucleon Beam Cannon Disruptor' have been updated. Additionally, Futsunomitama has been added as a Close-Range weapon. To obtain the Futsunomitama, you will need to repurchase the Mighty Strike Freedom Gundam from the in-game store.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added New builders parts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added New paint patterns.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added New diorama objects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added Photograph poses to the diorama mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added the ability to display area limits on the map (This can be switched in the configuration.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・The updated Wingman Settings are now applied to other missions.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Installing update is required for all online play.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More updates are still to come for Gundam Breaker 4!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
