  {
   "id": "gundam-breaker-4-287853@major-2024-10-24",
   "gameId": "gundam-breaker-4-287853",
   "displayName": "【Details of the new update patch】",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-24T02:25:51.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This update includes new Mobile Suits, improvements to gameplay stability and fixes for some of the known issues. Please update to the latest patch for the best experience!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "◆Details of update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "・Added a configuration option to turn on/off the warning display when selling or combining parts saved in the high rarity/inherent or single unit/label/blueprint categories",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added a sort filter for individual abilities on the assembly screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added “Order of Creation” to the sort options on the assembly screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Added a shortcut button for labels on the assembly screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・With the exception of some skills, a setting has been added to the configuration that allows you to activate Builder's Parts skills while maintaining their position and size, etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・A shortcut to the shop has been added to the menu in the lobby",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・With the exception of some parts, the emissive color has been reflected in the GN particle effects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・The lock-on function would not focus on the destructed part without a break point in the boss battle",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・ Improved the camera mouse control in the lobby and during missions on the Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Online play requires the player to apply this update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Further updates will be distributed in the future for you to continue to enjoy Gundam Breaker 4 more comfortably. Thank you for your continued support.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
